 "remarks": "89 Shore Road is just what you've been looking for! Located south of the village of Old Greenwich and walking distance to the town's coveted beach, this handsome Dutch colonial home boasts 4 bedrooms and 4 1/2 bathrooms with an option for a 5th bedroom suite on the fully finished third floor. A fabulous gourmet kitchen, formal living room with fireplace, office/sunroom and family room with fireplace complete the first floor. The private backyard oasis is ideal for outdoor entertaining and enjoyment. Don't miss the opportunity to view this classic and updated property in a sought after neighborhood .",
